  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Cashing In
  - key: BUTTON_FREE_SPIN_START
    value: START
  - key: PAYTABLE_CASH
    value: <style=title><size=32>CASH SYMBOL</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_CASH_DESCRIPTION
    value: "<size=16>\n - On reel 1, Cash Symbol with values 1, 2, 5 or 10 only appears.
      \  \n - On reel 2, Cash Symbol with values 5 or 0 only appears.\n - On reel
      3, Cash Symbol with values 5, 0 or 00 only appears.\n - There is no payline
      but a combination of Cash Symbols with bet multiplier \n   is awarded per Reel
      Set.\n - Player can create 10500 with Cash Symbols per Reel Set.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DIAMOND_JACKPOT
    value: <style=title><size=32>DIAMOND & JACKPOT</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DIAMOND_JACKPOT_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "<size=16>\n12 Diamonds awards Grand Jackpot\n10-11 Diamonds awards Major
      Jackpot\n8-9 Diamonds awards Minor Jackpot \n5-7 Diamonds awards Mini Jackpot
      \n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DIAMOND_JACKPOT_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: "<size=16>\n - Diamond Symbol appears anywhere on reels and regardless
      of Reel Set, \n   5 or more Diamonds on reels awards a Jackpot depending \n
      \  on the amount of Diamond Symbols.\n - After Re-Spin, Jackpot is NOT awarded
      additionally.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_RESPIN
    value: <style=title><size=32>RE-SPIN</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_RESPIN_DESCRIPTION
    value: "<size=16>\n - Only if one or two Cash Symbol with 0 or  00 appears and
      there'\u2019s no payout \n   in a reelset, Re-Spin is triggered on that reelset.\n
      - During Re-Spin, triggering spot(s) is locked.\n</size>"
